supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§13.2 introduction and §13.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"340; 369"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"360; 389"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,K\">\\(C,K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_C B\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le C(B\\upharpoonright n)+c,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_C B\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le C(B\\upharpoonright n)+c,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_K B\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(B\\upharpoonright n)+c,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_K B\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(B\\upharpoonright n)+c,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_C B\\leftrightarrow A\\le_C B\\land B\\le_C A,\\qquad A\\equiv_K B\\leftrightarrow A\\le_K B\\land B\\le_K A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_C B\\leftrightarrow A\\le_C B\\land B\\le_C A,\\qquad A\\equiv_K B\\leftrightarrow A\\le_K B\\land B\\le_K A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>全局一个加性常数必须同时适用于所有长度，不能依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§13.2 introduction and §13.9；印刷页 340; 369，PDF 页 360; 389。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in2^\\omega$；$C,K$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in2^\\omega$；$C,K$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"C,K","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_C B\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le C(B\\upharpoonright n)+c,","display":true},{"tex":"A\\le_K B\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(B\\upharpoonright n)+c,","display":true},{"tex":"A\\equiv_C B\\leftrightarrow A\\le_C B\\land B\\le_C A,\\qquad A\\equiv_K B\\leftrightarrow A\\le_K B\\land B\\le_K A.","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1492,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]] — Initial-Segment C and K Reducibility"},{"id":"5ff9ef2df9bbb0b4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_K$ 见 [[43-df-complexity-red]]；$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 声明的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。"},{"id":"e7523d1f0e830eb6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\le_K$ 与 $\\mathrm{KTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-ktrivial]]；$A,B,X\\in2^\\omega$。"},{"id":"251c0dafcec6b490","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\le_K$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}$、$\\mathrm{Random}_n$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\oplus$ 采用 [[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-vl-red]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]。"},{"id":"b7e62f31e9a6d8a9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]。$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\le_K,\\le_C$、$\\le_m$ 分别见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-many-one]]。"},{"id":"209fec8d943431a6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 与 $\\equiv_K$ 分别见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]。商集的底集由下式显式给出。"},{"id":"4a237fe7d7707f5f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\le_K$、$\\le_T$、$\\oplus$ 与跳跃采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"39d4d75d292f4550","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in(0,1)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)$；$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$ 满足 $\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}$、$\\beta=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y(n)2^{-(n+1)}$ 及 $\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(Y)$。实数左 c.e. 性与序列随机性分别采用 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]；$\\equiv_C,\\equiv_K$ 见 [[43-df-complexity-red]]。"},{"id":"e7c4e1881f3fc819","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\in2^\\omega$；归约与复杂度见 [[43-df-relative-K-red]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]。"},{"id":"6360e1eff68a99fe","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]，$\\le_C,\\le_K$ 采用 [[43-df-complexity-red]]。"},{"id":"c5ed5575b30a3867","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_{\\rm sw}$、$\\le_C$、$\\le_K$ 见 [[43-df-sw-red]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]。"}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8","6cd902d852c2c848","565c3258eee2a5ff"]}